1
00:00:03,201 --> 00:00:08,208
Default deployments are the models that profiles use when they do not choose their own.

2
00:00:08,208 --> 00:00:13,216
The Default chat deployment writes the answers, and the Default utility deployment does

3
00:00:13,216 --> 00:00:17,361
small jobs, such as planning and understanding the intent of a message.

4
00:00:17,812 --> 00:00:22,032
The Default embedding deployment turns text into numbers for search.

5
00:00:22,032 --> 00:00:25,283
It must be the one that your knowledge indexes use.

6
00:00:25,283 --> 00:00:30,872
The Default vision deployment reads pictures, and the Default image deployment creates them.

7
00:00:31,322 --> 00:00:34,441
The speech deployments transcribe and speak.

8
00:00:34,441 --> 00:00:41,862
The Default text-to-speech voice is the voice, and the Default realtime deployment carries a spoken conversation.

